TEXT 96 48 Left 3 ;#406 Linear capacitor ramp using a current regulator diode
TEXT 96 112 Left 2 ;Source: Alan Wolke (W2AEW), https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VXZH3UE-kSw
TEXT 96 160 Left 2 ;A current regulator diode charges the capacitor at nearly constant current once the discharge switch opens.
TEXT 96 576 Left 2 ;S1 and V2 stand in for Alan's manual discharge switch, which opens here at 1 ms.
TEXT 96 616 Left 2 ;The two ramp measurements use the 0.66 V and 7.94 V cursor levels Alan reads on his scope.
TEXT 96 672 Left 2 !.tran 0 2m 0 1u
TEXT 96 712 Left 2 !.options plotwinsize=0
TEXT 96 752 Left 2 !.model DISCHARGE SW(Ron=0.1 Roff=1G Vt=2.5 Vh=0.1)
TEXT 96 832 Left 2 !.include ..\..\LTspice\Models\Unverified\1N5297_illustrative.lib
TEXT 800 672 Left 2 !.meas tran RAMP_LO WHEN V(RAMP)=0.66 RISE=1
TEXT 800 712 Left 2 !.meas tran RAMP_HI WHEN V(RAMP)=7.94 RISE=1
TEXT 800 752 Left 2 !.meas tran RAMP_SLOPE PARAM 7.28/(RAMP_HI-RAMP_LO)
TEXT 800 792 Left 2 !.meas tran I_CHARGE AVG I(C1) FROM 1.2m TO 1.9m
